# Copy to `.env` and fill in. NEVER commit the real `.env`.

# --- Integration tests / deployer ---
# Private key (0x-prefixed) of a funded StudioNet account. StudioNet is gasless,
# so any account works; this is only needed by `gltest` integration runs.
DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY=

# --- Contract address (set after `genlayer deploy`) ---
# Used by gltest integration runs. NOTE: the web app does NOT read this.
CLIMATECLAIM_ADDRESS=

# --- Network chosen for integration runs ---
GLTEST_NETWORK=studionet

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Frontend (frontend/) — nothing to configure, and deliberately so.
#
# The app reads its network, contract address and explorer URL from typed
# config files, not from environment variables:
#
#   frontend/src/config/network.ts    chains, RPC URLs, explorer availability
#   frontend/src/config/contracts.ts  contract address and schema-derived method names
#
# This is on purpose. Vite inlines every VITE_* variable into the client
# bundle, so putting the contract address in one buys nothing and creates a
# second place for it to drift out of sync with the deployed contract.
#
# There are NO secrets in the app. It is read-only by default; sending a
# transaction requires a browser wallet, which holds its own key and is never
# given to this codebase.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------